# OBSOLETE — active development has moved to the `SuperQuench` branch

This branch (`master`) is the frozen state of the code used to produce:

  A. Florio, E. Grossi, A. Mazeliauskas, A. Soloviev, D. Teaney,
  "Supercooled Goldstone Bosons at the QCD Chiral Phase Transition,"
  Phys. Rev. Lett. 135 (2025) no.24, 242303
  doi:10.1103/wyn4-ncdc, arXiv:2504.03516 [hep-ph].

The exact publication snapshot is preserved by the annotated tag
`arxiv-2504.03516` (identical to the tip of this branch).

Ongoing development uses the CMake-based layout on the `SuperQuench`
branch, which is now the default branch on GitHub.

---

## Original README

This directory is the initial steps with petsc and MODELA
Now contains the code for:
- 2D heat equation
- 3D heat equation for 4 fields
- Model A pf O(4) without noise
